  "body": "<p align=\"center\">\r\n  <br>\r\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/antonmedv/walk/raw/master/.github/images/demo.gif\" width=\"600\" alt=\"Walk Demo\">\r\n  <br>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\nWalk — a terminal file manager.\r\n\r\n**In this release:**\r\n- Fixed: startPath not being set properly by @aymanbagabas in https://github.com/antonmedv/walk/pull/163\r\n- **Added syntax highlighting** by @aymanbagabas in https://github.com/antonmedv/walk/pull/162  \r\n  <img width=\"600\" alt=\"SCR-20250219-mlto-2\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/436b43c8-1d76-48a7-8b85-ec9ce21a2cd7\" />\r\n\r\n",
